<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.0021in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  You can now either select an existing document you want to edit by double clicking on that help document or you can create a new help document by clicking on the New Entry button on the action bar.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  The following information is required before you can enter the actual help text.  </run><run
><font style='bold italic' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Read the following before starting.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='2.4000in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'/>
<par def='4'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>English Subject:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  the English text as you want it appear in the list of help documents and on the help document when it is opened.</run></par>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='2.3903in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'/>
<par def='5'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>French Subject:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  the French equivalent to the English subject.  You cannot leave this blank, something must be entered even if it is only a space.</run></par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='1.2500in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='6'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>English Category:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  pick the most suitable category from the pull down.</run></par>
<pardef id='7' leftmargin='2.8097in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'/>
<par def='7'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>English Sub-Category:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  pick the most suitable sub-category from the pull down or create a sub-category by entering text in the New Keywords box at the bottom of the sub-category box.  Once entered, it cannot be deleted!!</run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>French Category:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  select the French equivalent to the English category.  Be sure to pick the same category!!</run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>French Sub-Category:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  select the French equivalent to the English sub-category or create a sub-category.</run></par>
<pardef id='8' leftmargin='2.1701in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'/>
<par def='8'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Document #:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  enter the document number for the selected sub-category.  This number determines the order in which documents are displayed when someone views the list of help documents in a sub-category.</run></par>
<pardef id='9' leftmargin='2.3500in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='1.2500in'/>
<par def='9'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Sub-Category#:</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  this number determines the order of the sub-categories under a category.  For example, if you want "Receiving and Reconciling Orders" help documents to appear before "Customizing the Application" documents under the category of "Database Custodian Guide", the </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>"Receiving and Reconciling Orders"</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> documents must all have a number 1 in the Sub-Category field and the "Customizing the Application" documents must all have a number 2.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
